t` stamp in `clear_absent` and observing the integration test go RED. Runtime investigation proved this is a FALSE PREMISE: `clear_absent` is never reached on a healthy in-window pass — both call sites (`binding_walk.py:254`, `outbound_differ.py:675`) are gated on out-of-window-but-alive keys, and the idempotency fixture seeds all keys in-window, so the seeded mutation left the test GREEN. The delivered guard is at the unit tier (AC#1/AC#4, landed via Gerrit 1911).\n\nScope: extend the test harness so the moved absence/tombstone cluster (`clear_absent` + siblings in `binding_lifecycle.py`) has an integration-tier mutation oracle that actually exercises an out-of-window path, giving AC#2-style protection a reachable seam. Out of scope for the session that discovered it.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":3,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"6045-bdf3-ddad-4461","ticket_type":"story","title":"Add integration-tier mutation oracle for out-of-window binding-lifecycle absence cluster (02c4 AC#2 harness gap)","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["e9cd381d-a344-4f99-998c-3ca869fd61c8","643aa7c7-90bb-4073-be43-3a535086016b"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1787178582889562001,"uuid":"31396394-98f7-469c-8b15-03872fa5cd1d"}